Subject: [PATCH] M2 review 29 candidate: C1 revision 2 -- the identity role
 guard applies to single-literal verdicts (a held conflict keeps its targeted
 read; the final verdict is guarded); identity-role-guard-2026-10-02.2; tests

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
